  "prefLabel": "We 1001.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 1001.01 Purpose. We 1000 establishes the procedures for implementing RSA 482-B:18, relative to the creation of a registry of complaints and for providing information contained in the registry to the public.\n\nSource. #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9179, eff 6-13-08; ss by #12083, eff 3-1-17",
